{"name": "Bandit Trap", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Get ready for the ultimate boobytrap friends showdown \u2014 always playable solo, or online with your friends.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>CAUSE CHAOS:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Asymmetric 3v1 multiplayer</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Physics\u2011based gameplay</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Destructible, reactive environments</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build devastating trap combinations</strong> to outsmart invading Bandits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Strategic loadouts</strong> with perks, scanners, and tools</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>PLAY YOUR WAY:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Perfect for parties</strong>, co\u2011op sessions, and online game nights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Play solo</strong> with smart AI bots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fast, replayable matches</strong> full of unpredictable moments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Free seasons</strong> with<strong>\u00a0</strong>new cosmetics to unlock</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"208\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982360/extras/1983fc05710f19036353869c397a7869.avif?t=1779802407\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982360/extras/c5ca1d720f7ce5f9a702a496d37cee41.poster.avif?t=1779802407\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982360/extras/c5ca1d720f7ce5f9a702a496d37cee41.webm?t=1779802407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982360/extras/c5ca1d720f7ce5f9a702a496d37cee41.mp4?t=1779802407\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strategise with your crew, choose the right gear, perks and map out tactics before the match starts. Choose wisely and outsmart the Trapper with the right setup!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982360/extras/70b1342243c24d8bba0db3cc7a6581bc.poster.avif?t=1779802407\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982360/extras/70b1342243c24d8bba0db3cc7a6581bc.webm?t=1779802407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982360/extras/70b1342243c24d8bba0db3cc7a6581bc.mp4?t=1779802407\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Evade traps, fight the Trapper and master a huge variety of scanners and tools to loot hidden treasures.\u00a0Survive the Trapper attacks and find all 10 hidden treasures to claim victory!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"208\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982360/extras/699713bfd0b904c921194214a695b3d0.avif?t=1779802407\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"b